<title>POLAND: ARIEL SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>ARIEL SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> SEPTEMBER		1996	1995</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.63 vs   0.78</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.06 vs   0.78</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.00 vs   0.81</p>
<p> Sales		    3.57 vs   2.82</p>
<p> JANUARY-SEPTEMBER    1996	1995</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.96 vs   1.49</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.62 vs   1.49</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.77 vs   1.74</p>
<p> Sales		    9.58 vs   7.81</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish shoe firm is Ariel SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
